</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Type_system" title="Type system">Typing discipline</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1288773161" about="#mwt14" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Cslist/styles.css&quot;}}"><ul class="cslist"><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Affine_type_system" title="Affine type system" class="mw-redirect">Affine</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Type_inference" title="Type inference">inferred</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nominal_type_system" title="Nominal type system">nominal</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Static_typing" title="Static typing" class="mw-redirect">static</a></li><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strong_and_weak_typing" title="Strong and weak typing" class="mw-redirect">strong</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Implementation language</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OCaml" title="OCaml">OCaml</a> (2006–2011)<br>Rust (2012–present)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computing_platform" title="Computing platform">Platform</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cross-platform" title="Cross-platform" class="mw-redirect">Cross-platform</a><sup about="#mwt20" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;note&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-3&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-3" data-mw-group="note" id="mwEQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEw">[</span>note 1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operating_system" title="Operating system">OS</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cross-platform" title="Cross-platform" class="mw-redirect">Cross-platform</a><sup about="#mwt26" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;note&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-4&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-4" data-mw-group="note" id="mwFQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFw">[</span>note 2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_license" title="Software license">License</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIT_License" title="MIT License">MIT</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apache_License" title="Apache License">Apache 2.0</a><sup about="#mwt36" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;note&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-7&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-7" data-mw-group="note" id="mwGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">[</span>note 3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org